{"schema_version":"talkami_new_spoken_topic_v3_frequency_sorted","status":"draft_pending_native_review","theme_id":"02.04","theme_title":"等人改约","theme_title_my":"လူစောင့်ခြင်းနှင့် ချိန်းဆိုချိန် ပြောင်းခြင်း","locale_pair":"zh-CN/my","updated_at":"2026-11-11","phrase_count":101,"original_count":75,"added_count":35,"note":"Utility-prioritized Chinese learner phrases, unneeded/duplicative expressions removed. New IDs and audio indexes synchronized; Burmese final review not completed.","scenes":[{"id":"02.04.01","title":"询问到哪儿","title_my":"ဘယ်အထိ ရောက်နေပြီလဲ မေးခြင်း","phrase_count":30,"original_count":23,"added_count":9,"phrases":[{"id":"02.04.01-S001","text":"到了吗？","meaning_my":"ရောက်ပြီလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S001_reply01","text":"还没，快到了。","meaning_my":"မရောက်သေးဘူး၊ ရောက်တော့မယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S001_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S001_alt01","text":"到地方了吗？","meaning_my":"ချိန်းထားတဲ့နေရာ ရောက်ပြီလား။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S001_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S001","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S002","text":"到哪儿了？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်အထိ ရောက်ပြီလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S002_reply01","text":"刚到地铁站。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ မြေအောက်ရထားဘူတာ ရောက်တာ။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S002_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S002_alt01","text":"你现在到哪儿了？","meaning_my":"အခု ဘယ်အထိ ရောက်နေပြီလဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S002_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“到哪儿了？”通常是问路途中走到哪个位置，不是在问对方的籍贯或住址。","text_my":"“到哪儿了？” က လမ်းမှာ ဘယ်အထိ ရောက်နေပြီလဲ မေးတာပါ။ ဇာတိနဲ့ နေရပ်လိပ်စာကို မေးတာ မဟုတ်ဘူး။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.01-S002","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S003","text":"还有多久？","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် ဘယ်လောက်ကြာဦးမလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S003_reply01","text":"大概还要十分钟。","meaning_my":"နောက်ဆယ်မိနစ်လောက် လိုဦးမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S003_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S003_alt01","text":"还要多长时间？","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် ဘယ်လောက်ကြာဦးမလဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S003_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“还有多久？”问剩余需要的时间，不是问两地距离。","text_my":"“还有多久？” က ရောက်ဖို့ အချိန် ဘယ်လောက်လိုသေးလဲ မေးတာပါ။ အကွာအဝေးကို မေးတာ မဟုတ်ဘူး။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.01-S003","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S004","text":"你出发了吗？","meaning_my":"ထွက်လာပြီလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S004_reply01","text":"出发了，在路上。","meaning_my":"ထွက်လာပြီ၊ လမ်းမှာ။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S004_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S004_alt01","text":"你已经出发了吗？","meaning_my":"ထွက်လာပြီးပြီလား။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S004_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S004","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S005","text":"大概几点能到？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်နှနာရီလောက် ရောက်နိုင်မလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S005_reply01","text":"七点左右到。","meaning_my":"ခုနစ်နာရီလောက် ရောက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S005_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S005_alt01","text":"大概什么时候到？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်အချိန်လောက် ရောက်မလဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S005_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S005","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S006","text":"在路上。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှာပါ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S006_alt01","text":"还在路上。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှာပဲ ရှိသေးတယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S011_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S011","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S007","text":"我十分钟后到。","meaning_my":"နောက်ဆယ်မိနစ်ဆို ရောက်မယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S012","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S008","text":"刚出发。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ ထွက်လာတာ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S013","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S009","text":"有点堵车。","meaning_my":"ကား နည်းနည်းပိတ်နေတယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S009_reply01","text":"那路上小心。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို လမ်းမှာ သတိထားနော်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S014_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S014","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S010","text":"我已经到附近了。","meaning_my":"ဒီနားရောက်နေပြီ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S015","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S011","text":"我快到门口了。","meaning_my":"တံခါးဝ ရောက်တော့မယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S011_alt01","text":"快到入口了。","meaning_my":"ဝင်ပေါက် ရောက်တော့မယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S017_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S017","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.01-S012","text":"我还在等你。","meaning_my":"စောင့်နေတုန်းပဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S012_reply01","text":"不好意思，让你等了。","meaning_my":"စောင့်ခိုင်းမိလို့ တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S006_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S012_alt01","text":"我还在这儿等着呢。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ စောင့်နေတုန်းပဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S006_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S006","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S013","text":"离这里还有多远？","meaning_my":"ဒီကိုရောက်ဖို့ ဘယ်လောက်ဝေးသေးလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S013_reply01","text":"还有两公里左右。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် နှစ်ကီလိုမီတာလောက် ဝေးသေးတယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S007_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S007","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S014","text":"你现在在路上吗？","meaning_my":"အခု လမ်းမှာလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S014_reply01","text":"对，还在路上。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ လမ်းမှာပဲ ရှိသေးတယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S008_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S008","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S015","text":"到附近了告诉我。","meaning_my":"ဒီနားရောက်ရင် ပြောနော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S009","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S016","text":"你坐上车了吗？","meaning_my":"ကားပေါ် တက်ပြီးပြီလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S016_reply01","text":"刚上车。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ ကားပေါ် တက်တာ။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S010_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S010","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S017","text":"你先进去吧。","meaning_my":"အထဲ အရင်ဝင်နှင့်ပါ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S016","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S018","text":"我到楼下了，入口在哪儿？","meaning_my":"အဆောက်အအုံအောက် ရောက်ပြီ၊ ဝင်ပေါက် ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S018_reply01","text":"就在一楼大厅旁边。","meaning_my":"မြေညီထပ် ဧည့်ခန်းမဘေးမှာပဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S018_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S018","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S019","text":"我已经出门了。","meaning_my":"အိမ်က ထွက်လာပြီ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S020","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S020","text":"我刚坐上公交车。","meaning_my":"ခုနကမှ ဘတ်စ်ကားပေါ် တက်တာ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S021","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S021","text":"我快到了，再等我一下。","meaning_my":"ရောက်တော့မယ်၊ ခဏထပ်စောင့်ပါဦး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S021_alt01","text":"我马上到了，再等等我。","meaning_my":"ရောက်တော့မယ်၊ ခဏ ထပ်စောင့်ပေးဦးနော်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S022_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S022","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S022","text":"你先点菜吧，不用等我。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းအရင်မှာထားလိုက်ပါ၊ မစောင့်နဲ့နော်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S022_reply01","text":"好，我先点。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အရင်မှာထားလိုက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S023_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S023","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S023","text":"你现在在哪儿？","meaning_my":"အခု ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S023_reply01","text":"在地铁站附近。","meaning_my":"မြေအောက်ရထားဘူတာနားမှာ။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S024_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S023_alt01","text":"你在哪个位置？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်နေရာမှာ ရှိနေလဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S024_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S024","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S024","text":"路上堵车吗？","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှာ ကားပိတ်နေလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S024_reply01","text":"有点堵，可能晚几分钟。","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်း ကားပိတ်လို့ မိနစ်အနည်းငယ် နောက်ကျနိုင်တယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S026_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S026","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S025","text":"要不要我过去接你？","meaning_my":"လာကြိုပေးရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S025_reply01","text":"不用，我自己过去。","meaning_my":"မလိုဘူး၊ ကိုယ်တိုင် လာလိုက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S027_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S027","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S026","text":"别着急，路上小心。","meaning_my":"အလျင်မလိုနဲ့၊ လမ်းမှာ သတိထားနော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S028","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S027","text":"我在老地方等你。","meaning_my":"အရင်ချိန်းနေကျ နေရာမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.01-S027_alt01","text":"我在原来约好的地方等你。","meaning_my":"အရင်ချိန်းထားတဲ့နေရာမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S029_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S029","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S028","text":"我已经等了半小时了。","meaning_my":"နာရီဝက် စောင့်နေရပြီ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.01-S028_reply01","text":"真不好意思，我快到了。","meaning_my":"တကယ် အားနာပါတယ်၊ ရောက်တော့မယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.01-S030_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“已经等了半小时”说明半小时已经过去，和“再等半小时”不同。","text_my":"“已经等了半小时” က နာရီဝက် စောင့်ပြီးပြီဆိုတဲ့ အဓိပ္ပာယ်ပါ။ နောက်ထပ် နာရီဝက် စောင့်ဖို့ ပြောတာ မဟုတ်ဘူး။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.01-S030","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S029","text":"你到了直接进来。","meaning_my":"ရောက်ရင် တန်းဝင်လာခဲ့နော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S031","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.01-S030","text":"快到的时候告诉我。","meaning_my":"ရောက်ခါနီးရင် ပြောနော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.01-S032","priority":"situational"}]},{"id":"02.04.02","title":"迟到说明","title_my":"နောက်ကျသည့်အကြောင်း ရှင်းပြခြင်း","phrase_count":25,"original_count":18,"added_count":9,"phrases":[{"id":"02.04.02-S001","text":"不好意思，我迟到了。","meaning_my":"တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်၊ နောက်ကျသွားတယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S001_reply01","text":"没关系，先坐吧。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ အရင်ထိုင်ပါဦး။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S002_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.02-S001_alt01","text":"对不起，我来晚了。","meaning_my":"တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်၊ နောက်ကျမှ ရောက်လာလို့။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S002_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“我迟到了”说已经迟到；“我会晚十分钟”说预计会迟到十分钟。","text_my":"“我迟到了” က နောက်ကျသွားပြီးသားပါ။ “我会晚十分钟” က ဆယ်မိနစ်လောက် နောက်ကျမယ်လို့ ကြိုပြောတာ။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.02-S002","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S002","text":"不好意思，出门晚了。","meaning_my":"တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်၊ အိမ်ကထွက်တာ နောက်ကျသွားလို့။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S002_reply01","text":"没事，路上小心。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ လမ်းမှာ သတိထားနော်။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S001_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.02-S002_alt01","text":"抱歉，我出门晚了。","meaning_my":"တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်၊ အိမ်ကထွက်တာ နောက်ကျသွားလို့။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S001_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S001","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S003","text":"我会晚十分钟。","meaning_my":"ဆယ်မိနစ်လောက် နောက်ကျမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S003_reply01","text":"好，我再等十分钟。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ဆယ်မိနစ် ထပ်စောင့်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S005_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.02-S003_alt01","text":"我大概要晚十分钟。","meaning_my":"ဆယ်မိနစ်လောက် နောက်ကျမယ်ထင်တယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S005_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S005","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S004","text":"临时有点事耽误了。","meaning_my":"ရုတ်တရက် ကိစ္စတစ်ခုကြောင့် နောက်ကျသွားတယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S004_reply01","text":"没关系，到了再说。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ရောက်မှ ပြောကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S011_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.02-S004_alt01","text":"临时有事耽误了时间。","meaning_my":"ရုတ်တရက် ကိစ္စပေါ်လာလို့ အချိန် နောက်ကျသွားတယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S011_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S011","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S005","text":"路上太堵了，得晚点到。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှာ ကားအရမ်းပိတ်လို့ နောက်ကျမှ ရောက်မယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S005_reply01","text":"没事，注意安全。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ လမ်းမှာ သတိထားပါ။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S018_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.02-S005_alt01","text":"路上太堵，我要晚点才能到。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှာ ကားအရမ်းပိတ်လို့ နောက်ကျမှ ရောက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S018_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S018","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S006","text":"路上有点堵。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှာ ကားနည်းနည်း ပိတ်နေတယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S006_reply01","text":"那可能要晚一点了。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို နည်းနည်း နောက်ကျနိုင်တယ်နော်။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S019_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S019","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S007","text":"刚下班，马上过去。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ အလုပ်ဆင်းတာ၊ ချက်ချင်း လာမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S020","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S008","text":"我尽快赶过去。","meaning_my":"တတ်နိုင်သမျှ မြန်မြန် လာမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S008_reply01","text":"好，我在里面等你。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အထဲမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S023_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S023","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S009","text":"不好意思，让你久等了。","meaning_my":"အကြာကြီး စောင့်ခိုင်းမိလို့ တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S009_reply01","text":"没事，我也刚到。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ကိုယ်လည်း အခုမှ ရောက်တာ။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S024_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.02-S009_alt01","text":"抱歉，让你等了这么久。","meaning_my":"ဒီလောက်ကြာ စောင့်ခိုင်းမိလို့ တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S024_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“让你久等了”是在见面时向等待很久的人表示歉意。","text_my":"“让你久等了” က အကြာကြီး စောင့်ပေးရတဲ့သူကို တောင်းပန်ပြောတဲ့ စကားပါ။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.02-S024","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S010","text":"地铁晚点了。","meaning_my":"မြေအောက်ရထား နောက်ကျသွားတယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S010_reply01","text":"那你慢慢来。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ဖြည်းဖြည်း လာပါ။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S003_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S003","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S011","text":"没事，路上注意安全。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ လမ်းမှာ သတိထားပါ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S004","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.02-S012","text":"没关系，我在这儿等你。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ဒီမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S006","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S013","text":"我刚从公司出来。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ ကုမ္ပဏီက ထွက်လာတာ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S013_reply01","text":"那还要多久？","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို နောက်ထပ် ဘယ်လောက်ကြာဦးမလဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S007_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S007","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S014","text":"大概七点十分到。","meaning_my":"ခုနစ်နာရီ ဆယ်မိနစ်လောက် ရောက်မယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S008","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S015","text":"还有五分钟就到。","meaning_my":"နောက်ငါးမိနစ်ဆို ရောက်တော့မယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S015_reply01","text":"好，到了给我发消息。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ရောက်ရင် စာပို့နော်။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S009_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S009","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S016","text":"我刚下地铁。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ မြေအောက်ရထားပေါ်က ဆင်းတာ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S010","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S017","text":"不用在门口等我。","meaning_my":"တံခါးဝမှာ စောင့်နေစရာ မလိုဘူး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S012","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S018","text":"没事，慢慢来。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ဖြည်းဖြည်းလာပါ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S013","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S019","text":"我等你。","meaning_my":"စောင့်နေမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S014","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S020","text":"到了告诉我。","meaning_my":"ရောက်ရင် ပြောနော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S015","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S021","text":"下次提前跟我说一声。","meaning_my":"နောက်တစ်ခါ ကြိုပြောပေးနော်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S016","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S022","text":"我先进去等。","meaning_my":"အထဲ အရင်ဝင်စောင့်မယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S017","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S023","text":"下次我会早点出门。","meaning_my":"နောက်တစ်ခါ အိမ်က စောစော ထွက်ပါ့မယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S025","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S024","text":"我刚叫了车。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ ကားခေါ်လိုက်တာ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S026","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.02-S025","text":"我走错路了。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှားသွားလို့ပါ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.02-S025_reply01","text":"那你先找找路，别着急。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို လမ်းကို သေချာရှာပါ၊ အလျင်မလိုနဲ့။","previous_id":"02.04.02-S027_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.02-S027","priority":"situational"}]},{"id":"02.04.03","title":"修改时间","title_my":"ချိန်းထားသည့်အချိန် ပြောင်းခြင်း","phrase_count":24,"original_count":19,"added_count":9,"phrases":[{"id":"02.04.03-S001","text":"能改时间吗？","meaning_my":"အချိန် ပြောင်းလို့ရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S001_reply01","text":"可以，你想改到几点？","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ဘယ်နှနာရီ ပြောင်းချင်လဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S001_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.03-S001_alt01","text":"可以换个时间吗？","meaning_my":"အချိန်တစ်ခု ပြောင်းလို့ရမလား။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S001_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S001","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S002","text":"我们改个时间吧。","meaning_my":"အချိန်တစ်ခု ပြန်ချိန်းကြရအောင်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S002_reply01","text":"行，那重新定一下时间。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ဒါဆို အချိန် ပြန်ချိန်းကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S020_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S020","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S003","text":"推迟半小时吧。","meaning_my":"နာရီဝက် နောက်ရွှေ့ကြမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S003_reply01","text":"好，那就晚半小时见。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ဒါဆို နာရီဝက် နောက်ရွှေ့ပြီး တွေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S002_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.03-S003_alt01","text":"往后推半个小时吧。","meaning_my":"နာရီဝက် နောက်ရွှေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S002_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“推迟半小时”是比原定时间晚30分钟；“提前半小时”则是早30分钟。","text_my":"“推迟半小时” က မူလချိန်းထားတာထက် မိနစ်သုံးဆယ် နောက်ရွှေ့တာပါ။ “提前半小时” က စောရွှေ့တာ။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.03-S002","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S004","text":"好，那就往后推半小时。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ဒါဆို နာရီဝက် နောက်ရွှေ့လိုက်ကြမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S003","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S005","text":"半小时不够，能晚一小时吗？","meaning_my":"နာရီဝက်နဲ့ မရဘူး၊ တစ်နာရီ နောက်ရွှေ့လို့ရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S005_reply01","text":"可以，晚一小时吧。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ တစ်နာရီ နောက်ရွှေ့လိုက်ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S004_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“晚一小时”这里是在商量把约定往后调整一小时，不是说已经迟到一小时。","text_my":"ဒီနေရာက “晚一小时” က ချိန်းထားတဲ့အချိန်ကို တစ်နာရီ နောက်ရွှေ့တာပါ။ တစ်နာရီ နောက်ကျပြီးသား မဟုတ်ဘူး။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.03-S004","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S006","text":"能换到明天吗？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် ပြောင်းလို့ရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S006_reply01","text":"可以，明天下午吧。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ မနက်ဖြန် နေ့လယ်နောက်ပိုင်းပဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S010_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.03-S006_alt01","text":"明天见可以吗？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် တွေ့လို့ရမလား။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S010_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S010","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S007","text":"那就改到明天。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို မနက်ဖြန် ပြောင်းလိုက်ကြမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S018","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S008","text":"能早点见吗？","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်း စောစော တွေ့လို့ရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S008_reply01","text":"可以，提前半小时吧。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ နာရီဝက် စောပြီး တွေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S019_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.03-S008_alt01","text":"能提前见面吗？","meaning_my":"စောစော တွေ့လို့ရမလား။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S019_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S019","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S009","text":"往后推一点行吗？","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်း နောက်ရွှေ့လို့ရမလား။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.03-S009_alt01","text":"能稍微推迟一点吗？","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်း နောက်ရွှေ့လို့ရမလား။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S021_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S021","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S010","text":"提前半小时行吗？","meaning_my":"နာရီဝက် စောပြီး တွေ့လို့ရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S010_reply01","text":"可以，提前半小时。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ နာရီဝက် စောချိန်းကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S022_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S022","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S011","text":"你几点方便？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်နှနာရီ အားလဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S011_reply01","text":"晚上七点有空。","meaning_my":"ည ခုနစ်နာရီ အားတယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S023_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S023","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.03-S012","text":"改到四点。","meaning_my":"လေးနာရီကို ပြောင်းလိုက်ကြမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S012_reply01","text":"好，就四点。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ လေးနာရီပဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S006_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S006","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S013","text":"新时间发我一下。","meaning_my":"အချိန်အသစ်ကို ပို့ပေးပါဦး။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S013_reply01","text":"好，我发给你。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ပို့ပေးမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S007_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S007","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S014","text":"我四点以后才方便。","meaning_my":"လေးနာရီကျော်မှ အားမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.03-S014_alt01","text":"四点以后我才有空。","meaning_my":"လေးနာရီကျော်မှ အားမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S008_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“四点以后”指晚于四点，和“四点就可以”不完全一样。","text_my":"“四点以后” က လေးနာရီကျော်မှ ဖြစ်မယ်ဆိုတဲ့ သဘောပါ။ “လေးနာရီတိတိ ရတယ်” လို့ အမြဲမဆိုလိုဘူး။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.03-S008","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S015","text":"那个时间我赶不过去。","meaning_my":"အဲဒီအချိန်အမီ မရောက်နိုင်ဘူး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S009","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S016","text":"晚上七点可以吗？","meaning_my":"ည ခုနစ်နာရီဆို ရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S016_reply01","text":"七点可以。","meaning_my":"ခုနစ်နာရီ ရတယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S011_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.03-S016_alt01","text":"晚上七点方便吗？","meaning_my":"ည ခုနစ်နာရီ အားလား။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S011_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S011","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S017","text":"改时间没问题。","meaning_my":"အချိန်ပြောင်းတာ ပြဿနာမရှိဘူး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S012","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S018","text":"那五点吧。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ငါးနာရီပဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S018_reply01","text":"好，五点见。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ငါးနာရီ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S013_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S013","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S019","text":"我看看时间。","meaning_my":"အချိန် ကြည့်လိုက်ဦးမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S014","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S020","text":"明天上午可以。","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် မနက်ပိုင်း ရတယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S015","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S021","text":"换到晚上可以吗？","meaning_my":"ညဘက်ကို ပြောင်းလို့ရမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S021_reply01","text":"好，晚上七点吧。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ည ခုနစ်နာရီပဲနော်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S025_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S025","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S022","text":"改到周末行吗？","meaning_my":"စနေ၊ တနင်္ဂနွေကို ပြောင်းလို့ရမလား။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S026","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S023","text":"我可能赶不上原来的时间。","meaning_my":"မူလချိန်းထားတဲ့အချိန်ကို မမီလောက်ဘူး။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S023_reply01","text":"没事，重新约个时间。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ အချိန် ပြန်ချိန်းကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S027_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S027","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.03-S024","text":"新时间确定了吗？","meaning_my":"အသစ်ချိန်းထားတဲ့အချိန် သေချာပြီလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.03-S024_reply01","text":"定了，改到明天四点。","meaning_my":"သေချာပြီ၊ မနက်ဖြန် လေးနာရီ ပြောင်းလိုက်ပြီ။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S028_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.03-S024_alt01","text":"新时间已经定了吗？","meaning_my":"အချိန်အသစ် သတ်မှတ်ပြီးပြီလား။","previous_id":"02.04.03-S028_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.03-S028","priority":"situational"}]},{"id":"02.04.04","title":"取消改天","title_my":"ချိန်းထားသည်ကို ဖျက်ပြီး နောက်မှပြန်ချိန်းခြင်း","phrase_count":22,"original_count":15,"added_count":8,"phrases":[{"id":"02.04.04-S001","text":"我今天来不了了。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ မလာနိုင်တော့ဘူး။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S001_reply01","text":"没事，那改天吧。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ဒါဆို နောက်နေ့မှပဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S001_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.04-S001_alt01","text":"今天没法过去了。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ မလာနိုင်တော့ဘူး။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S001_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“来不了了”表示原本打算来，但现在无法赴约。","text_my":"“来不了了” က မူလက လာဖို့ရှိပေမဲ့ အခု မလာနိုင်တော့ဘူးလို့ ဆိုလိုတယ်။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.04-S001","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S002","text":"我临时有事，去不了了。","meaning_my":"ရုတ်တရက် ကိစ္စပေါ်လာလို့ မသွားနိုင်တော့ဘူး။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S002_reply01","text":"没关系，你先处理。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ အရင် ကိစ္စရှင်းလိုက်ပါ။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S003_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S003","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S003","text":"我们改天再约。","meaning_my":"နောက်နေ့မှ ပြန်ချိန်းကြတာပေါ့။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.04-S003_alt01","text":"改天再约吧。","meaning_my":"နောက်နေ့မှ ပြန်ချိန်းကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S004_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S004","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S004","text":"要不改到明天？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် ပြောင်းကြမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S004_reply01","text":"可以，明天下午吧。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ မနက်ဖြန် နေ့လယ်နောက်ပိုင်းပဲ။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S015_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.04-S004_alt01","text":"要不明天再约？","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန် ပြန်ချိန်းကြမလား။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S015_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S015","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S005","text":"今天先取消吧。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့တော့ အစီအစဉ် ဖျက်လိုက်ကြမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S005_reply01","text":"好，那下次再见。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ဒါဆို နောက်တစ်ခါမှ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S016_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S016","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S006","text":"那今天就算了吧。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ဒီနေ့တော့ ထားလိုက်ကြမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S006_reply01","text":"好，那今天先不见了。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ဒါဆို ဒီနေ့တော့ မတွေ့ဖြစ်တော့ဘူး။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S020_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S020","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S007","text":"不好意思，让你白跑一趟。","meaning_my":"တကူးတက လာရပြီး အလကားဖြစ်သွားလို့ တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S007_reply01","text":"没关系，下次见。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ နောက်တစ်ခါ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S021_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“让你白跑一趟”说明对方特意来却没办成事情，可用来表示歉意。","text_my":"“让你白跑一趟” က တစ်ဖက်လူ တကူးတက လာရပြီး အလုပ်မဖြစ်ခဲ့တာကို ဆိုလိုတယ်။ တောင်းပန်တဲ့အခါ သုံးတတ်တယ်။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.04-S021","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S008","text":"那我先回去了。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို အရင် ပြန်လိုက်မယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.04-S008_alt01","text":"那我就先回去了。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို အရင် ပြန်လိုက်မယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S022_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S022","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S009","text":"要不改到下周？","meaning_my":"နောက်အပတ်ကို ပြောင်းကြမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S009_reply01","text":"好，下周再联系。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ နောက်အပတ်မှ ပြန်ဆက်သွယ်ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S023_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S023","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S010","text":"没事，你先忙你的。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ လုပ်စရာရှိတာ အရင်လုပ်ပါ။","replies":[],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.04-S010_alt01","text":"没关系，你先忙吧。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ အရင် လုပ်စရာရှိတာလုပ်ပါ။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S002_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S002","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S011","text":"我今天得加班。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ အချိန်ပိုဆင်းရမယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S011_reply01","text":"那你先忙工作。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို အလုပ်ကို အရင်လုပ်ပါ။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S005_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S005","priority":"core"},{"id":"02.04.04-S012","text":"我临时走不开。","meaning_my":"ရုတ်တရက် ကိစ္စပေါ်လာလို့ ထွက်မလာနိုင်ဘူး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","notes":[{"type":"usage","text":"“走不开”是被当前的事绊住，暂时无法离开，不一定是完全没有空闲时间。","text_my":"“走不开” က လက်ရှိကိစ္စကြောင့် ထွက်မလာနိုင်သေးတာပါ။ အချိန်လုံးဝ မအားဘူးလို့ မဆိုလိုဘူး။"}],"previous_id":"02.04.04-S006","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.04-S013","text":"今天实在赶不过去。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေ့ တကယ် အချိန်မီ မရောက်နိုင်တော့ဘူး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S007","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.04-S014","text":"要不周末再约？","meaning_my":"ပိတ်ရက်မှ ထပ်ချိန်းကြမလား။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S014_reply01","text":"好，周六怎么样？","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ စနေနေ့ဆိုရော။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S008_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.04-S014_alt01","text":"要不周六周日再约？","meaning_my":"စနေ၊ တနင်္ဂနွေမှ ပြန်ချိန်းကြမလား။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S008_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S008","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.04-S015","text":"下次我请你。","meaning_my":"နောက်တစ်ခါ ကိုယ်ပဲ ဝယ်ကျွေးမယ်နော်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S015_reply01","text":"好，那下次见。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ နောက်တစ်ခါ တွေ့ကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S009_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S009","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.04-S016","text":"这周先不约了。","meaning_my":"ဒီအပတ်တော့ မချိန်းတော့ဘူး။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S016_reply01","text":"好，那下周再约。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ နောက်အပတ်မှ ပြန်ချိန်းကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S010_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S010","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.04-S017","text":"有事提前说就行。","meaning_my":"ကိစ္စရှိရင် ကြိုပြောရုံပဲ။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S017_reply01","text":"好，我下次提前说。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ နောက်တစ်ခါ ကြိုပြောမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S011_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S011","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.04-S018","text":"周末再联系吧。","meaning_my":"ပိတ်ရက်မှ ပြန်ဆက်သွယ်ကြမယ်။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S012","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.04-S019","text":"没事，下次再约。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ နောက်တစ်ခါမှ ပြန်ချိန်းကြတာပေါ့။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S013","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.04-S020","text":"我这边还没忙完。","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်မှာ အလုပ်မပြီးသေးဘူး။","replies":[],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S014","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.04-S021","text":"这次真的不好意思。","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ခါ တကယ် အားနာပါတယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S021_reply01","text":"没事，下次再约。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ နောက်တစ်ခါ ပြန်ချိန်းကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S017_reply01"}],"alternatives":[],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S017","priority":"situational"},{"id":"02.04.04-S022","text":"没关系，工作要紧。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ အလုပ်က အရေးကြီးတယ်။","replies":[{"id":"02.04.04-S022_reply01","text":"谢谢理解，下次再约。","meaning_my":"နားလည်ပေးလို့ ကျေးဇူးပါ၊ နောက်တစ်ခါ ပြန်ချိန်းကြမယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S019_reply01"}],"alternatives":[{"id":"02.04.04-S022_alt01","text":"没事，工作更重要。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ အလုပ်က ပိုအရေးကြီးတယ်။","previous_id":"02.04.04-S019_alt01"}],"pinyin":null,"phonetic_my":null,"pronunciation_source":"not_generated","pronunciation_qa":"pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review","previous_id":"02.04.04-S019","priority":"situational"}]}],"extras_summary":{"main":101,"replies":57,"alternatives":32,"notes":11,"total_audio":190},"quality_review":{"date":"2026-11-11","status":"draft_pending_native_review","ids_reindexed":true,"before":110,"after":101,"removed":9}}
